{
    "title": "Chispa: Dating App for Latinos",
    "description": "CHISPA is the perfect dating app for single Latina women and single Latino men. Its mission is to create an exclusive community where Latin people can match and make meaningful connections with people who share similar likes and interests.\r\n\r\nCHISPA is easy and fun to match and date with your dream Latina or Latino\r\n\u2022  Simply scroll through a personalized list of dating profiles.\r\n\u2022  If you're interested in an attractive single, slide the dating profile to the right to give the person a \u2018Like\u2019, or click the 'Heart' icon.\r\n\u2022  If the feeling is mutual, then you are a match and can start chatting in our app right away.\r\n\u2022 Not interested and looking for a different match? Slide the profile to the left to see the next person who would like to date you, or click the \u2018X\u2019 icon.\r\n\r\nAs soon as you join CHISPA, all members can\r\n\u2022 Become a part of CHISPA exclusive community for single Latina women and single Latino men.\r\n\u2022 Like and chat with other available Latin members near you.\r\n\u2022 Customize who and what you look for, make your dating profile even more intriguing.\r\n\u2022 Receive a personalized group of dating profiles to look through every day to find the perfect match!\r\n\u2022 When they like you back, chat and date with other Latin members. Who knows, maybe love is in the air!\r\n\r\nGo Premium and date better\r\n\"\u2022 Send 5 Super CHISPAs* per week to stand out from the crowd and let other single people know that you're truly interested. \r\n\"\r\n\u2022 Rewind on people to give them a second chance\r\n\u2022 Boost your dating profile each month to be one of the top dating profiles in your area for 30 minutes\r\n\u2022 Send unlimited likes to other Latin members\r\n\u2022 Have an uninterrupted dating experience with no ads!\r\n\r\nGo Elite and date even better\r\n\u2022 Get all the Premium benefits AND remove the mystery and see who likes you for instant matches!\r\n\r\n\r\n*A super CHISPA is essentially a super like, it lets someone know that you swiped right on them before they swipe on you and, it highlights your profile to them.",
